    "elements": [
      {
        "id": "diagram-3e04979a-7104-4bff-b69d-f252d9b3c82c",
        "kind": "diagram",
        "ownerId": "project-46fd9abf-e819-45fa-ad0a-2c9c698d8d3b",
        "name": "00 Stakeholder Needs",
        "documentation": "",
        "properties": {
          "diagramKind": "requirements",
          "markdown": "# Dot Dash stakeholder needs\n\nWhat players need from Dot Dash, in their own terms. These are the top of the trace tree: each system requirement in 01 Requirements refines one or more of these needs, and the manual acceptance checks in 04 Verification Plan validate them.\n\n## NEED-001 Quick offline play\n\nA player can open the app on iPhone or iPad and be playing a short reflex game within seconds, with no account, purchase or network connection.\n\n## NEED-002 Fair, escalating challenge\n\nSuccess depends only on the player's timing, the rules are easy to read, and the game gets harder as the player succeeds, with a gentler and a harder variant to choose from.\n\n## NEED-003 Durable progress\n\nA player's best result for each variant survives closing the app and updates, and is never lowered or lost.\n\n## NEED-004 Interruption-safe play\n\nA call, notification or switch to another app never lets the game keep running unattended or produce a result the player did not earn.\n\n## NEED-005 Comfortable presentation and feedback\n\nThe player can choose a light or dark presentation and gets clear visual and haptic feedback on success and failure.\n\n## NEED-006 Help when needed\n\nThe player can reach the developer for help from inside the app.\n\n## Trace summary\n\n| Need | Refined by system requirements |\n| --- | --- |\n| Quick offline play (NEED-001) | REQ-001, REQ-006, REQ-012 |\n| Fair, escalating challenge (NEED-002) | REQ-002, REQ-003, REQ-004, REQ-005, REQ-006, REQ-008 |\n| Durable progress (NEED-003) | REQ-005, REQ-010, REQ-012 |\n| Interruption-safe play (NEED-004) | REQ-007 |\n| Comfortable presentation and feedback (NEED-005) | REQ-004, REQ-009, REQ-011 |\n| Help when needed (NEED-006) | REQ-012 |"
        },
        "createdAt": "2026-10-28T17:30:31.612Z",
        "modifiedAt": "2026-10-28T17:30:31.612Z"
      },
